      "widgets_values": [
        "Premium digital drawing for the SAME illustrated book as image4. Portrait1024x1536. INPUT ROLES: image1 approved shared physical SCALE plate, image2 Shir identity/outfit, image3 Skitters hatchling identity, image4 approved page STYLE and SAFE FRAMING. Keep warm pale cream, moss green, soft hand-drawn contours and luminous ordinary garden. Shir nine, blue eyes, honey dark blonde topknot at scalp apex, normal child head proportions, lilac shirt, dusty rose shorts, pink patterned fabric sport sandals with black soles/connectors. Pink backpack: three HUNTR/X girls print ONLY on rear panel; front torso view shows straps/plain pink side, never rear print. Skitters same small puppy-sized HATCHLING every page: light turquoise, butter yellow belly, apricot wing undersides, amber eyes, ivory horn buds, golden forehead star; four legs TWO wings ONE tail. Scale image1 is authoritative: Shir130cm, dragon shoulder18cm, snout-to-rump30cm excluding20cm tail, headtop approx36cm. Never enlarge dragon for composition or shrink for a sandal. Same ground depth. Full figure composition closely matches approved image4 framing: Shir scalp/bun no higher than40% image height, soles around85%; dragon head about73%, paws85%. Quiet pale almost empty UPPER38% for HTML text. Bottom12% empty path; ALL essential bodies/tails/contact within central60% width. No text, lettering, diagrams, panels, speech bubbles. Ordinary stone garden path and shrubs, subtle warm glow, no fantasy flowers or beings, no door unless requested. One clear story moment. Shir full-body left turns head toward trees, one hand cupped near mouth calling for someone, other hand gently moves aside a low branch. Skitters sits on path beside broken eggshell right looking up at her. She searches for caretaker, worried curious. No other people or creatures, no footprints or implied abandonment. Pink backpack perspective correct.",
